flowchart TD
    %% INPUT
    U([User<br/>natural-language request<br/>python -m src.main 'query']) --> AG[Agent loop src/agent.py<br/>plan, act, check, retry once]
    AG --> G1[Input guardrail<br/>validate, sanitize, length check]
    G1 -- invalid --> ERR([Safe error message])
    G1 -- valid --> SAFE{Safety guardrail<br/>self-harm language?}
    SAFE -- yes --> HELP([Support resources, no songs])

    %% RETRIEVAL
    SAFE -- no --> QP[Query parser<br/>split wanted vs avoided text]
    QP --> RET[Retriever<br/>stemmed TF-IDF cosine over knowledge base]
    KB[(data/knowledge_base.json<br/>genre, mood, situation entries)] --> RET
    SN[(data/song_notes.json<br/>per-song documents)] --> RET
    RET -- confidence below 0.15 --> AG
    AG -- typo fix failed --> ASK([Clarifying question])
    KB -. file missing .-> FB[Fallback<br/>default profile]

    %% GENERATION
    RET -- retrieved entries + similarity --> PROF[Profile builder<br/>weighted genres, moods, energy, acoustic<br/>minus avoided genres and moods]
    PROF --> SC[Scoring engine<br/>genre > mood > energy closeness > acoustic]
    SONGS[(data/songs.csv)] --> SC
    SONGS --> FB
    SC --> G2[Output guardrail<br/>every song must exist in catalog]
    G2 --> EXP[Explanation builder<br/>score reasons + cited sources]
    EXP -. optional --llm .-> LLM[Ollama LLM<br/>writes explanation from retrieved context<br/>--style default or concise few-shot]
    LLM --> G3[Grounding guardrail<br/>no other catalog songs, length cap]
    G3 -- rejected or Ollama down --> EXP
    G3 -- accepted --> OUT
    FB --> OUT
    EXP --> OUT([Ranked recommendations<br/>+ confidence + sources])

    %% LOGGING
    G1 -.-> LOG[(logs/vibefinder.log)]
    RET -.-> LOG
    PROF -.-> LOG
    SAFE -.-> LOG

    %% TESTING AND HUMAN REVIEW
    EVAL[Evaluator src/evaluate.py<br/>20 fixed checks x5 runs] -. exercises .-> G1
    EVAL --> REP[docs/evaluation_results.md]
    UT[pytest tests/] -. verifies .-> RET
    UT -. verifies .-> G1
    UT -. verifies .-> SC
    OUT --> CHK[Agent check<br/>top pick must fit the inferred profile]
    CHK --> AG
    AG -. traces .-> TR[(docs/ai_interactions.md<br/>logs/agent_traces.jsonl)]
    OUT --> H{{Human review<br/>read results and eval report}}
    REP --> H
    H -. edit entries, weights, thresholds .-> KB
